  "description": "After both of his legs are severed during his fierce battle with Obi-Wan Kenobi on Mustafar, Anakin Skywalker is more dead than alive. As his battered body sizzles in lava, he barely notices the arrival of Darth Sidious, who still sees potential in his battered apprentice. Soon, Anakin is resurrected in the cold, metallic shell of Darth Vader, all traces of his former decency and humanity now vanished. Adding to his personal pain: the Dark Lord is told that, in a fit of anger, he inadvertently killed Padmé Amidala, his great love. Now Vader is poised to become the symbolic monarch of everything the Empire represents...a remorseless, back-clad dispenser of death in the shadow of his evil master"
